          "speaker": "B",
          "hanzi": "没关系啦。请进，请坐。",
          "pinyin": "Méi guānxi la. Qǐng jìn, qǐng zuò.",
          "english": "It's okay. Please come in and sit down."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "hanzi": "谢谢您！",
          "pinyin": "Xièxie nín!",
          "english": "Thank you!"
        },
        {
